{"about_the_game":"<strong>Star Mountain</strong> is a fast paced 1v1 game where you must race to get a star before your opponent. Build your own platforms, and block your opponent to get to the star first!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freeze Yourself to Reach New Heights</h2>The core mechanic of <strong>Star Mountain</strong> is the ability to build your own platforms, using you and your opponents characters to reach the star. By frequently <strong>freezing</strong> your character, you can be <strong>offensive</strong> to create your own path to victory, or <strong>defensive</strong> to block in your opponent.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.poster.avif?t=1750263681\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.webm?t=1750263681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.mp4?t=1750263681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online and Local Multiplayer</h2>Friends are across the world? Got no friends? No matter! <strong>Star mountain</strong> features <strong>online multiplayer</strong> so you can play with amazing strangers and maybe meet your new best friend! Or, if you're lucky and have friends, there is also <strong>local multiplayer</strong>! (With split keyboard and controller compatibility)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As featured in Wonderville arcade in New York City!</h2>From March 1st - June 1st 2024, <strong>Star Mountain</strong> was featured in an arcade cabinet thanks to Mark Kleback and the team at <strong>Wonderville NYC</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/67774581c8e93514874afe32beadaece.avif?t=1750263681\" width=616 height=462 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2938920?t=1750263681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2938920?t=1750263681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750263681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750263681","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Star Mountain</strong> is a fast paced 1v1 game where you must race to get a star before your opponent. Build your own platforms, and block your opponent to get to the star first!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freeze Yourself to Reach New Heights</h2>The core mechanic of <strong>Star Mountain</strong> is the ability to build your own platforms, using you and your opponents characters to reach the star. By frequently <strong>freezing</strong> your character, you can be <strong>offensive</strong> to create your own path to victory, or <strong>defensive</strong> to block in your opponent.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.poster.avif?t=1750263681\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.